-    private static FORMATION_STATE_NAMES: string[] = [ 'CANDIDATE', 'TRAILING', 'CONVERGING' ];
-
-    // Evidence-accumulation and lock-proof thresholds. EVIDENCE_MS: how
-    // long a consistent route relation (same segment for CONVERGING,
-    // exactly one route edge behind for TRAILING) must hold before trusted —
-    // long enough to reject single-frame/packet-timing noise (a handful of
-    // frames at any sane framerate), short enough to resolve well within
-    // one convergence attempt. GAP_NEAR_ZERO remains a trailing-collapse
